:"Meanwhile, wash and dry the fresh produce.","secondary_message":"1 bunch radish\n1 English cucumber\n1 ½ tomatoes"},{"id":160766,"primary_message":"Trim off and discard tops and root ends of radishes. Thinly slice and transfer to a plate.","secondary_message":null},{"id":160767,"primary_message":"Trim off and discard ends of the cucumber; slice crosswise into ¼-inch pieces at an angle. Add to the plate.","secondary_message":null},{"id":160768,"primary_message":"Slice tomatoes into rounds and add to the plate. Season veggies with salt and pepper.","secondary_message":"3 pinch salt\n3 pinch black pepper"},{"id":160769,"primary_message":"Halve and toast rolls.","secondary_message":"6 whole grain buns or rolls"},{"id":160770,"primary_message":"Combine goat cheese and yogurt in a medium bowl and mash with a fork until smooth and creamy. ","secondary_message":"3 (113 g) logs goat cheese\n1 ½ cups plain Greek yogurt"},{"id":160771,"primary_message":"Spread goat cheese mixture over toasted rolls. Layer with smoked salmon, cucumber, tomato, radish, and capers. ","secondary_message":"3 (113 g) pkg smoked salmon\n3 tbsp capers"},{"id":160772,"primary_message":"To serve, divide between plates and top with \"Everything\" spice. Enjoy!","secondary_message":null}],"line_items":[{"id":167184,"quantity":"3 tbsp","ingredient_name":"capers"},{"id":167192,"quantity":"1","ingredient_name":"English cucumber"},{"id":167185,"quantity":"3 cloves","ingredient_name":"garlic"},{"id":167190,"quantity":"3 (113 g) logs","ingredient_name":"goat cheese"},{"id":167189,"quantity":"1 ½ cups","ingredient_name":"plain Greek yogurt"},{"id":167198,"quantity":"1 bunch","ingredient_name":"radish"},{"id":167194,"quantity":"½ medium","ingredient_name":"red onion"},{"id":167197,"quantity":"3 (113 g) pkg","ingredient_name":"smoked salmon"},{"id":167195,"quantity":"1 ½","ingredient_name":"tomatoes"},{"id":167191,"quantity":"6","ingredient_name":"whole grain buns or rolls"},{"id":167187,"quantity":"","ingredien